# Day 1 requests. Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman.
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. All employees -> 200
GET {{base}}/employees

### 2. IT department only -> 200
GET {{base}}/employees?departmentId=1

### 3. Search by name -> 200
GET {{base}}/employees?search=ali

### 4. One employee -> 200
GET {{base}}/employees/2

### 5. Missing employee -> 404
GET {{base}}/employees/99

### 6. Hire -> 201
POST {{base}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Youssef Samir", "jobTitle": "Analyst", "salary": 16000, "departmentId": 3 }

### 7. Invalid data -> 400 with a list of errors
POST {{base}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Yo", "salary": 10, "departmentId": 9 }

### 8. Promote -> 200
PUT {{base}}/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ahmed Ali", "jobTitle": "Senior Developer", "salary": 30000, "departmentId": 1 }

### 9. Delete -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/employees/1

### 10. Unknown route -> 404
GET {{base}}/salaries
